# r1113 chunk 4, boot A rerun (c4_ar): the c4_a rows that faulted, judged in perf/runs/r1113/verdicts/c4_a.md.
# Rows: SQ-GAP-04 (golden apple, gold ingot and block recipes not covered in c4_a), SQ-BREED-03, SQ-HCS-07, SQ-HCS-12,
# SQ-FLR-03, -02b (setup), -04, -05, SQ-RD-11, SQ-FDI-02, -03.
#
# Setup: NO fresh world. Reuse the c4_a scratch dir and world as they are (OUT = the c4_a scratch dir, srv = OUT/srv,
# level r1113c4a, spawn-animals=true, SoL Carrot jar still in srv/mods, the same dev jars prep_srv swapped in for c4_a,
# Loading Protection 1 s). Only the fixed /zc4 probe changes:
#   cp $INST/tools/scratch_query/zc4_probe.js OUT/srv/kubejs/server_scripts/zz_zc4_probe.js
# (the other probes, zz_zq_probe.js, zz_hh_crow_probe.js, zz_zact_probe.js, zz_count.js, zz_trades.js, are already in
# srv/kubejs/server_scripts from c4_a and unchanged). No kjsexpect rows, no /reload, no /dumpall.
#
# Fixes against c4_a:
#  - zc4_probe.js: arguments split as a JS string (String(argStr)); every multi-argument /zc4 call (put, fill, inv, pools,
#    fuel, eat, hunger, sol ITEM, isfood, bees) got the whole argument string as a[0] in c4_a. fill uses
#    Fluid.of(id, mB).getFluidStack(); fuel uses BlazeBurnerBlock.tryInsert (the block entity's tryUpdateFuel is
#    protected) and prints the state in lower case (blaze=kindled).
#  - SQ-HCS-07: an empty-hand use takes one item INTO the main hand, and the next use inserts that held item back
#    (NestBlock.use), so c4_a's 6 plain uses netted nothing. Now: sneak + one use (takes everything), clear, reopen.
#    The nests are set to air first (a setblock of the same state keeps the old block entity, no LootTable).
#  - SQ-HCS-12: the wild crow flies off the bot before the tame (c4_a: "tamed 0" with a radius 6 box); tame at once,
#    box over the whole glass cage.
#  - SQ-BREED-03: a second bees reading (bees inside the hive are not entities).
#  - SQ-FLR-05: each mixer driven through a cogwheel beside it (a motor facing down never turns a mixer).
#  - SQ-RD-11: 60 novice farmers (13+ novice listings, 2 picked per villager; 10 villagers showed no cotton by chance).
#  - SQ-FDI-02 / -03: new bot names fdj / fdk (the c4_a bot fdi already has player data in this world).
# Areas as c4_a (z 40000 lane): nests 40000-40030, crow box 40100, Create rigs 40200-40260, cakes 40600, bees 40700.
pace 2

